{"seq":1,"slug":"indexeddb","title":"IndexedDB 浏览器内置数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-storage-persistence/structured/indexeddb","wordCount":1230,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"indexeddb-浏览器内置数据库\">IndexedDB 浏览器内置数据库</h1><p>当你的数据超过了 <a href=\"../key-value/web-storage\">Web Storage</a> 的五兆上限、需要按字段查询、或者要在 Worker 里访问，就到了 IndexedDB 的领地。它是浏览器内置的一个完整的事务型数据库：有对象仓库、有索引、有游标、有版本化的 schema 迁移，能存下结构化克隆算法能处理的任意 JavaScript 值，容量可达数 GB。代价是它的原生 API 以「繁琐到劝退」著称——基于事件回调、动作要包在事务里、连一次简单读取都要好几步。但理解它的事务模型与版本机制，是用好它（以及 Dexie、idb 这些上层封装）的唯一前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>IndexedDB 的结构是分层的：一个源下有多个数据库，一个数据库有多个对象仓库（object store，相当于表），仓库里存键值对形式的记录，记录可以建索引以支持按字段查询。所有读写都必须在事务里进行。下图描述这套层级与一次读写的路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[源 origin] --&gt; B[数据库 含版本号]&#10;  B --&gt; C[对象仓库 1]&#10;  B --&gt; D[对象仓库 2]&#10;  C --&gt; E[记录 主键→值]&#10;  C --&gt; F[索引 按字段查]&#10;  G[发起操作] --&gt; H[开启事务&lt;br/&gt;指定仓库+模式]&#10;  H --&gt; I{readonly 还是 readwrite}&#10;  I --&gt; J[在事务内 get/put/delete]&#10;  J --&gt; K[事务自动提交或回滚]\">graph TD\n  A[源 origin] --&gt; B[数据库 含版本号]\n  B --&gt; C[对象仓库 1]\n  B --&gt; D[对象仓库 2]\n  C --&gt; E[记录 主键→值]\n  C --&gt; F[索引 按字段查]\n  G[发起操作] --&gt; H[开启事务&lt;br/&gt;指定仓库+模式]\n  H --&gt; I{readonly 还是 readwrite}\n  I --&gt; J[在事务内 get/put/delete]\n  J --&gt; K[事务自动提交或回滚]</pre><p>下表把 IndexedDB 与其他客户端存储的能力放在一起对照。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>IndexedDB</th>\n<th>localStorage</th>\n<th>Cookie</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>容量</td>\n<td>数 GB（占共享配额）</td>\n<td>约 5MB</td>\n<td>每条约 4KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据类型</td>\n<td>结构化克隆任意值</td>\n<td>仅字符串</td>\n<td>仅字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询方式</td>\n<td>主键 + 索引 + 游标</td>\n<td>仅按键</td>\n<td>仅按键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事务</td>\n<td>有（ACID 范围内）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（同步）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Worker 可用</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"打开数据库与版本迁移\">打开数据库与版本迁移</h2><p>一切从 <code>indexedDB.open(name, version)</code> 开始。版本号是 IndexedDB schema 演进的核心机制：当你以更高的版本号打开一个已存在的库时，会触发 <code>upgradeneeded</code> 事件，所有「建仓库、建索引、改结构」的操作都只能在这个回调里做。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const request = indexedDB.open(&#39;app-db&#39;, 2);&#10;&#10;request.onupgradeneeded = (e) =&gt; {&#10;  const db = e.target.result;&#10;  if (e.oldVersion &lt; 1) {&#10;    const store = db.createObjectStore(&#39;notes&#39;, { keyPath: &#39;id&#39; });&#10;    store.createIndex(&#39;by_updated&#39;, &#39;updatedAt&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  if (e.oldVersion &lt; 2) {&#10;    // 从 v1 升到 v2 的增量迁移&#10;    const tx = e.target.transaction;&#10;    tx.objectStore(&#39;notes&#39;).createIndex(&#39;by_tag&#39;, &#39;tag&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;};&#10;&#10;request.onsuccess = (e) =&gt; {&#10;  const db = e.target.result; /* 使用 db */&#10;};&#10;request.onerror = (e) =&gt; console.error(&#39;打开失败&#39;, e.target.error);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> indexedDB.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'app-db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">request.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onupgradeneeded</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.target.result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e.oldVersion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> store</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createObjectStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'notes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { keyPath: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'by_updated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'updatedAt'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e.oldVersion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 从 v1 升到 v2 的增量迁移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.target.transaction;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">objectStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'notes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'by_tag'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tag'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">request.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onsuccess</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.target.result; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 使用 db */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">request.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onerror</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'打开失败'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, e.target.error);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>oldVersion</code> 让你写出增量迁移：从任何旧版本逐级升到当前版本，这对线上应用至关重要——用户的库可能停留在任意历史版本。schema 变更只此一处能做，是 IndexedDB 设计里最需要适应的一点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事务模型\">事务模型</h2><p>IndexedDB 的所有读写都发生在事务中。开启事务时要指定涉及哪些仓库、以及模式是 <code>readonly</code> 还是 <code>readwrite</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function putNote(db, note) {&#10;  return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {&#10;    const tx = db.transaction(&#39;notes&#39;, &#39;readwrite&#39;);&#10;    tx.objectStore(&#39;notes&#39;).put(note);&#10;    tx.oncomplete = () =&gt; resolve();&#10;    tx.onerror = () =&gt; reject(tx.error);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> putNote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">note</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'notes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'readwrite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">objectStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'notes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(note);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">oncomplete</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onerror</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tx.error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>事务有几个容易踩的特性。其一，事务会「自动提交」：当没有更多挂起的请求、且控制权交回事件循环时，它就提交了——这意味着你不能在 <code>await</code> 一个无关的 Promise 后再用同一个事务，因为它可能已经结束（<code>TransactionInactiveError</code>）。其二，事务提供有限范围内的 ACID 保证，出错会整体回滚。其三，<code>readwrite</code> 事务对同一仓库是串行的，过度使用会成为性能瓶颈。这套「事务必须连续、不能跨微任务」的约束，正是原生 API 难用的根源，也是封装库着力解决的痛点（见 <a href=\"../practice/libraries-patterns\">库与模式</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"索引与游标查询\">索引与游标查询</h2><p>IndexedDB 的查询能力来自索引和游标。索引让你按非主键字段查找，游标让你遍历范围、逐条处理大结果集而不必一次性载入内存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function notesByTag(db, tag) {&#10;  return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {&#10;    const tx = db.transaction(&#39;notes&#39;, &#39;readonly&#39;);&#10;    const index = tx.objectStore(&#39;notes&#39;).index(&#39;by_tag&#39;);&#10;    const results = [];&#10;    index.openCursor(IDBKeyRange.only(tag)).onsuccess = (e) =&gt; {&#10;      const cursor = e.target.result;&#10;      if (cursor) {&#10;        results.push(cursor.value);&#10;        cursor.continue();&#10;      } else resolve(results);&#10;    };&#10;    tx.onerror = () =&gt; reject(tx.error);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> notesByTag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'notes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'readonly'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> index</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">objectStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'notes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'by_tag'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    index.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openCursor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(IDBKeyRange.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">only</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tag)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onsuccess</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cursor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.target.result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cursor) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cursor.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cursor.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(results);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onerror</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tx.error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>IDBKeyRange</code> 支持 <code>only</code>、<code>bound</code>、<code>lowerBound</code>、<code>upperBound</code> 等范围查询，配合游标能做「取某时间段内的记录」这类操作。但 IndexedDB 不是 SQL：它没有 JOIN、没有任意条件组合，复杂查询要靠合理的索引设计或在应用层组装。容量虽大，仍受每源共享配额约束并可能被驱逐——配额与持久化见 <a href=\"../foundations/storage-limits-quota\">存储限制与配额</a> 与 <a href=\"../foundations/persistence-durability\">持久性与可靠性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适用场景与边界\">适用场景与边界</h2><p>IndexedDB 是离线应用、本地优先架构、客户端缓存大体量结构化数据的主力。邮件客户端缓存邮件、笔记应用存全部笔记、电商缓存商品目录、PWA 暂存离线编辑——这些都是它的主场。它也常作为 SQLite-in-the-browser（通过 WebAssembly）的持久化后端之一。但它不适合存「需要随请求上服务器」的数据（那是 <a href=\"../key-value/cookies\">Cookie</a> 的事），也不适合存 HTTP 响应缓存（那是 <a href=\"cache-storage\">Cache Storage</a> 的专长），更不该用来存几个简单的偏好开关（杀鸡用牛刀，用 <a href=\"../key-value/web-storage\">Web Storage</a> 即可）。把它的事务与同步特性组装成完整离线方案，是 <a href=\"../practice/offline-sync\">离线与同步</a> 的内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>IndexedDB 是浏览器内置的事务型数据库，支持对象仓库、索引、游标、版本迁移，容量数 GB，可在 Worker 中使用。</li>\n<li>schema 变更只能在更高版本号触发的 <code>upgradeneeded</code> 回调里做，用 <code>oldVersion</code> 写增量迁移以兼容线上各历史版本。</li>\n<li>所有读写都在事务中；事务会在交回事件循环时自动提交，不能跨 <code>await</code> 无关 Promise 后继续使用。</li>\n<li>查询靠索引 + 游标 + <code>IDBKeyRange</code>，但没有 SQL 式 JOIN，复杂查询靠索引设计或应用层组装。</li>\n<li>仍受每源共享配额约束、可能被驱逐，见 <a href=\"../foundations/storage-limits-quota\">存储限制与配额</a> 与 <a href=\"../foundations/persistence-durability\">持久性与可靠性</a>。</li>\n<li>原生 API 繁琐，生产中常用封装库简化，见 <a href=\"../practice/libraries-patterns\">库与模式</a>；HTTP 缓存用 <a href=\"cache-storage\">Cache Storage</a> 而非它。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：MDN <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/IndexedDB_API\">IndexedDB API</a>（2026-06 核对）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IndexedDB 浏览器内置数据库","id":"indexeddb-浏览器内置数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"打开数据库与版本迁移","id":"打开数据库与版本迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"事务模型","id":"事务模型"},{"level":2,"text":"索引与游标查询","id":"索引与游标查询"},{"level":2,"text":"适用场景与边界","id":"适用场景与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"存储事件与跨标签同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-storage-persistence/key-value/storage-events"},"next":{"title":"OPFS 与文件系统访问","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-storage-persistence/structured/opfs-file-system"}}